# Philosophy Tutor — daily lesson via Telegram.
#
# Run `send_daily.py` (through the `daily_lesson.sh` wrapper) every day at
# 05:00 (VPS timezone — the hour is set to 07:00 in the recipient's timezone,
# UTC+2; this server runs on UTC, hence 05:00 * * *). It generates the next
# lesson, converts the Markdown to Telegram HTML and delivers it to the chat
# configured in `.env` (TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN / TELEGRAM_USER_ID).
#
# Install with:
#   crontab crontab.example          # replaces your entire crontab
# (or append the single line below to your existing crontab with `crontab -e`).
#
# The wrapper uses absolute paths and the project venv, so it works with the
# minimal environment cron provides.
0 5 * * * /var/www/phylosophy_tutor/daily_lesson.sh